uploads/2024/01/games-5551-TrashTycoon1.jpeg","line":22,"embedded":true},{"title":"Manifesto for a Ludic Century","target":"https://kotaku.com/manifesto-the-21st-century-will-be-defined-by-games-1275355204","line":26},{"title":"A screengrab from a video game showing an animation of a book with the word LOOP and a Nabakov quote on the left-hand side, and a drawing of a girl holding a net on the right-hand side","target":"https://oh.imgix.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/16863635-loop-browser-title-screen.jpg","line":32,"embedded":true},{"title":"described the manifesto","target":"http://bogost.com/writing/blog/on_the_manifesto_for_a_ludic_c/","line":38},{"title":"described the","target":"https://gamedesignerben.tumblr.com/post/61666213605/the-ludic-century-a-fooferaw","line":38},{"title":"argued","target":"https://killscreen.com/previously/articles/uncomfortable-politics-ludic-century/","line":38},{"title":"called it","target":"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/design/brief-notes-on-the-ludic-century-manifesto","line":38},{"title":"admitting","target":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BNl_Rtwv25c","line":38},{"title":"A screenshot from the game showing customers and waiters in a restaurant","target":"https://oh.imgix.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/diner-dash-04-big.jpg","line":46,"embedded":true},{"title":"loyalty reward cards","target":"https://www.cioinsight.com/news-trends/make-every-customer-more-profitable-harrahs-entertainment-inc/","line":52},{"title":"A screenshot of a video game in which a pixel-art figure embarks on a long narrow passage with various obstacles","target":"https://oh.imgix.net/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/Passage.png","line":66,"embedded":true},{"title":"@mike\\_thomsen","target":"https://twitter.com/mike_thomsen?lang=en","line":78}],"metadata":{"title":"Life in the Ludic Century","source":"https://outland.art/manifesto-for-a-ludic-century/","author":["[[Gabrielle Schwarz]]"],"published":"2024-01-16","created":"2025-10-29","description":"In 2013, Eric Zimmerman predicted that the systemic logic of games would transform contemporary society. He was right—even if the effects were more nefarious than he’d imagined.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1hvxqek","at":1780884492865},"key":"Clippings/Life in the Ludic Century.md"},
